<!--Post: 6719--><!--Time: 1107981680-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6719"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:Iwillc@tchu.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Catcher<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Catcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 12:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->For those of us that live in Wichita, you all know who I am referring to.  Is there anyone here that has lived in the area long enough to give a more detailed description of Crazy Mike, and let the internet community in on some of the interesting theories and history with WPD this man has been associated with?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6719-->
<!--Post: 6725--><!--Time: 1107984045-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6725"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 1:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->WOW - are you talking about the crazy mike I knew from the late 70&#39; - early 80&#39;s???  <BR>Course it could be coincidental.  I am a Wichita Native - but I left for like 15 years the first time - and 17 years the second time. In my younger years I knew a &#34;crazy&#34; by the name of Crazy Mike....hmmm...it was a long time ago.  Lot&#39;s of parties at Cheney...and remeber the old &#34;Foundry&#34; bar? - on Douglas - he used to frequent there.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6725-->
<!--Post: 6749--><!--Time: 1107994290-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6749"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 4:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The guy that always wore headphones?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6749-->
<!--Post: 6754--><!--Time: 1107996286-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6754"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Birdieict<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Birdieict<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 4:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I hear he has been swabbed already. He was way up there on my list when BTK first returned.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6754-->
<!--Post: 6762--><!--Time: 1107999837-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6762"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kansasgirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kansasgirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 5:43 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I haven&#39;t seem him around much lately. How old is he?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6762-->
<!--Post: 6770--><!--Time: 1108002139-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6770"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 6:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OMG I had to laugh when I saw &#34;that crazy guy with the headphones&#34; I had no idea who crazy  <BR>Mike was but I&#39;ve seen that guy all over Wichita. He&#39;s always wearing knee high socks and shorts. He looks like he stepped out of a 1970&#39;s disco rollerskating movie or something. He does scoot around on roller skates too I think doesn&#39;t he? Oh I needed a good laugh. Thank you. now I finally know who that funky lookin&#39; guy is.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6770-->
<!--Post: 6772--><!--Time: 1108002620-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6772"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 6:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m not from Wichita and have no idea who this Crazy Mike guy is but he sounds too flamboyently odd to be a sucessfull BTK. <BR>You are an important group though who have posted on this thread. You are the ones from Wichita who sit next to BTK at a traffic light and never know it. I think it&#39;s going to be someone who lives in Wichita or once lived there or frequents there often to visit relatives who is ultimately going to come up with some seemingly inconsiquential lead that ultimately identifies BTK.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6772-->
<!--Post: 6773--><!--Time: 1108002834-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6773"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Neechi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Neechi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 6:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->LOL....&#34;Crazy Mike&#34;...I remember being in line behind him at Dillons at 21st and Rock several times many years ago.  He was always rude to the cashier and always paid with big bills, even if he was just buying gum.  I seem to remember a Corvette or some sort of sports car being associated with him.  The guy was/is definitely eccentric, but not a serial killer.  I hadn&#39;t thought about him in years! Thanks for the laughs!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6773-->
<!--Post: 6774--><!--Time: 1108002875-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6774"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 6:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK can not be that strange. He would be in jail if that were the case.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6774-->
